Because an application doesn't depend only on your source code.

It also depends on the environment.

For example:

Application
    │
    ├── Node.js version
    ├── npm version
    ├── OS
    ├── System libraries
    ├── Dependencies
    ├── Database
    ├── Redis
    ├── Environment variables
    └── Configuration

If these differ between machines, the application can behave differently.